| `scripts/marginal_rate_calc.py` | Marginal rate & savings per CHF 100 deduction | `--income --canton --status --deduction --category --json` |
| `scripts/family_marriage_sim.py` | Marriage penalty & dual-earner simulation | `--earner-a --earner-b --canton --children --json` |
