## Workflow
1. Ingest Lohnausweis + documents → deduction codes (see `references/deduction_taxonomy.md`)
2. Run scripts → quote JSON output verbatim
3. Generate deliverables from `templates/` (Steuerdossier, eTax guide, tax-saving report, Fristerstreckung)

## Privacy: Mask AHV (`756.xxxx.xxxx.xx`) and IBAN in all outputs.
## Language: Respond in user's language; official letters in canton's official language (DE/FR/IT).
